    Bug 2012697 - Migrate filter service alerts to Fluent. r=mkmelin,sking

    - Migrates filter backup, invalid header, and continue execution prompts to Fluent.
    - Modernizes nsMsgFilterService and nsMsgFilterAfterTheFact to use Fluent.
    - Consolidates legacy alerting and confirmation helpers into modern inline logic.
    - Removes unused nsIStringBundle methods and legacy prompt helpers.
    - Simplifies string conversions using NS_ConvertUTF16toUTF8 and NS_ConvertUTF8toUTF16.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D280611

